  basementCooling:
    'Please describe the cooling situation in the basement. **Intentional:** * Basement receives cooling in the same manner as the rest of the house. **Intentional w/ continuous circulation:** * Basement air is continuously exchanged with upper floors, equalizing temperatures. **Incidental-Desired (e.g. leaky ducts):** * Basement is semi-conditioned by presence of HVAC equipment. * Semi-conditioning is desired and measures will not be taken to eliminate it. * Thermal boundary for model will be located at basement walls and floor. **None or Undesired Incidental:** * Basement is not intentionally conditioned. * Incidental conditioning is undesired and considered wasted energy. * Thermal boundary for model will be the building floor above the basement. **Note:** If you choose "None or Undesired Incidental", then be sure to NOT include the basement square footage in the conditioned area of the home under the Building inputs.',
